WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:02.250
- So you have a ton of quick changes.

00:00:02.250 --> 00:00:05.130
People try and get me to do this thing,

00:00:05.130 --> 00:00:06.870
and (laughs) I, I-

00:00:06.870 --> 00:00:09.300
- It's exhausting.
- It's exhausting.

00:00:09.300 --> 00:00:11.100
And I'm like, I'm running back there

00:00:11.100 --> 00:00:12.960
and I'm like, I, do you ever miss,

00:00:12.960 --> 00:00:14.250
have you ever missed, one, a quick change,

00:00:14.250 --> 00:00:15.480
or have you ever like just come out

00:00:15.480 --> 00:00:17.610
and been like, "Well it
wasn't all put together"?

00:00:17.610 --> 00:00:19.170
- Yeah, "I didn't quite make it."

00:00:19.170 --> 00:00:20.003
No, you know what?

00:00:20.003 --> 00:00:22.140
I think that would be
such a fun game to do.

00:00:22.140 --> 00:00:23.551
- Oh.
- You should-

00:00:23.551 --> 00:00:25.513
- That should be a game on this show.

00:00:25.513 --> 00:00:26.838
- You could do a quick-change challenge.

00:00:26.838 --> 00:00:27.671
No, I'm just-

00:00:27.671 --> 00:00:29.117
- Quick Change Challenge is
our next game on this show.

00:00:29.117 --> 00:00:30.637
(laughs)
- I know, I know.

00:00:30.637 --> 00:00:32.640
But it was like, okay, I want the audience

00:00:32.640 --> 00:00:34.170
to try out a quick change challenge,

00:00:34.170 --> 00:00:35.940
see how quickly you can get out

00:00:35.940 --> 00:00:37.680
and back in to another set of clothes.

00:00:37.680 --> 00:00:39.510
I'm telling you, it is-
- It's thought out, yeah.

00:00:39.510 --> 00:00:40.590
Well, I've hosted the Billboard Awards,

00:00:40.590 --> 00:00:41.880
so that's the only time
I've done quick changes

00:00:41.880 --> 00:00:43.530
that are like, yeah, they're, it's like

00:00:43.530 --> 00:00:45.390
less than three minutes
sometimes or two minutes

00:00:45.390 --> 00:00:48.120
and it's like super quick
and it's like, I don't know-

00:00:48.120 --> 00:00:48.953
- Something breaks.

00:00:48.953 --> 00:00:51.190
- Something breaks, you go
out there like, "Just pin it!"

00:00:51.190 --> 00:00:52.860
- Yeah, no, exactly.

00:00:52.860 --> 00:00:54.360
There's lots of swearing
in the quick change.

00:00:54.360 --> 00:00:57.030
- Yes, 100%, no, we're really classy.

00:00:57.030 --> 00:00:59.460
That never happens.
- It's a scream.

00:00:59.460 --> 00:01:01.410
Swear fast, you have to
get out there in time.

00:01:01.410 --> 00:01:04.110
- So you've never come out
on stage and just completely,

00:01:04.110 --> 00:01:06.322
cuz one time in my quick
change they forgot to-

00:01:06.322 --> 00:01:07.860
- Zip you up?
- Do something.

00:01:07.860 --> 00:01:09.270
They zipped me but didn't do the,

00:01:09.270 --> 00:01:11.100
and I jumped around a lot on that tour

00:01:11.100 --> 00:01:13.770
and so my dress almost
came completely off.

00:01:13.770 --> 00:01:16.655
And I was commando (laughs)

00:01:16.655 --> 00:01:18.983
(audience laughs)

00:01:18.983 --> 00:01:22.890
so that that would've gone
real European beach real quick.

00:01:22.890 --> 00:01:24.960
- Yeah, holy.
- Caught it, I caught it.

00:01:24.960 --> 00:01:26.430
Has anything ever
happened to you like that?

00:01:26.430 --> 00:01:29.070
- I've had things like that
happen, I've had other,

00:01:29.070 --> 00:01:30.990
I think the biggest
mishap I've had on stage,

00:01:30.990 --> 00:01:33.229
well, actually, the biggest mishap

00:01:33.229 --> 00:01:34.290
I've had on stage was my horse.

00:01:34.290 --> 00:01:35.760
- Oh no.
- One time, yeah.

00:01:35.760 --> 00:01:39.708
My horse, I was on
stage, drops a big poop.

00:01:39.708 --> 00:01:41.610
(Kelly laughs)

00:01:41.610 --> 00:01:43.410
And I mean, it's big and it's steamy

00:01:43.410 --> 00:01:44.793
and it's stinky, you know?

00:01:45.840 --> 00:01:48.661
I mean, not for me, I love
the smell of horse poop.

00:01:48.661 --> 00:01:50.430
(Kelly laughs)

00:01:50.430 --> 00:01:52.613
Everything I own smells
like horse poop, but.

00:01:54.180 --> 00:01:56.400
But it was just really awkward, you know?

00:01:56.400 --> 00:01:59.043
And so I just had to say,
"Well, (beep) happens."

00:01:59.043 --> 00:02:00.997
(Kelly laughs)
(audience laughs)

00:02:00.997 --> 00:02:02.820
(audience applauds)

00:02:02.820 --> 00:02:05.640
- I actually would've loved that,

00:02:05.640 --> 00:02:07.293
being at that show, oh my gosh.

